# CloudFormation parameter files, written by hand beside a template and named by
# both deploy READMEs (`--parameter-overrides file://params.json`). Every ARN in
# one carries the AWS account id, and this repository is public: `deploy/ask/`
# and `deploy/site/` both keep the account out of the committed template on
# purpose, so the file that holds it is never committed either.
params.json
